  "Lines": {
    "s0": {
      "Text": "An Ancient Novictum Refiner. Keep it. I need Xan nanocrystals: take this Space-Time Extraction Device. The jars here are not responding, so take these samples and hand them to me one by one.{take JK05}{spawn JK06 1}{spawn JK07 1}{spawn JK08 1}{spawn JK09 1}{spawn JK0A 1}{completequest JS10}",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s1": {
      "Text": "Cracked, but useful. {take JK08}{completequest JS11}",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s1_need": {
      "Text": "Hand me the Cracked Xan Notum Crystal.",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s2": {
      "Text": "Deformed. Good. {take JK09}{completequest JS12}",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s2_need": {
      "Text": "Hand me the Deformed Xan Notum Crystal.",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s3": {
      "Text": "Pristine. Dr. Curry in the Halls of Scheol studies their language. Go to him. {take JK0A}{completequest JS13}",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s3_need": {
      "Text": "Hand me the Pristine Xan Notum Crystal.",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s4": {
      "Text": "A burial stone. Take it to Dr. Darnell. {take JK0K}{spawn JK0K 1}{completequest JS30}",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s4_need": {
      "Text": "Passive Aggressive Spirits near 1255 x 1770 carry the stones.",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s5": {
      "Text": "There is a scepter, a ritual artifact. It is close to Dr. Jones. Bring it.{completequest JS37}",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s6": {
      "Text": "A Xan Ritual Scepter. Find out if it works: the Moss Covered Altar in the Halls of Scheol, where the Great Mother waits. {take JK0L}{spawn JK0L 1}{completequest JS39}",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s6_need": {
      "Text": "Bring me the scepter.",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s7": {
      "Text": "Intact. Bring it to Dr. Darnell. {take JK0L}{spawn JK0L 1}{completequest JS41}",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s7_need": {
      "Text": "Show me the scepter.",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s8": {
      "Text": "A Broken Xan Prayer Urn. Vanward Four in Lower Scheol may know how to fix it. {take JK0O}{spawn JK0O 1}{completequest JS46}",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s8_need": {
      "Text": "Bring me an Urn from the foot of the rocky hill.",
      "Replies": [
        "bye"
      ],
      "Source": "filler"
    },
    "s9": {
      "Text": "Take this Scan of Yuttos Wall Carvings to Dr. Jones.{completequest JS49}",
